              <span id="db-total-badge" class="count-badge" style="background: rgba(124, 106, 255, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(124, 106, 255, 0.4); color: #a78bfa; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem; border-radius: 999px;">529 Novels</span>
